WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:02.969 line:0%
- YOU--LET ME THROUGH.

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:05.138 line:0%
THIS IS BULL[bleep], GENE.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:07.140
- WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WAIT.
WHAT'S THE MATTER, RICH?

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.341
- IN THE NEXT EPISODE

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:11.911
STEVE URKEL TURNS CARL
INTO A GIANT SANDWICH

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:13.513
