00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.348
- HA-HA, BUT WAIT,
THAT'S HILARIOUS, BUDDY.

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:16.582
IT'S HILARIOUS.
- COME ON!

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.217
I'M AN ACTOR, GENE!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.019
