TO BE ABOUT ME AND MY FAMILY.

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:21.421
- I KNOW,
BUT YOU KNOW, AFTER THAT--

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:23.222
AFTER THAT FIRST GUEST SPOT
WITH STEVE URKEL,

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:24.891
I MEAN, AMERICA FELL IN LOVE
WITH HIM, MAN.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.726
WE HAD TO MAKE HIM A REGULAR,
AND NOW, YOU KNOW--

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:28.895
HEY, LISTEN, HE'S THE STAR
OF THE SHOW NOW, SWEETHEART.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:29.996
WE GOTTA PLAY BALL, BUBBELEH.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:32.298
- DON'T YOU DARE
"BUBBELEH" ME, GENE.

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:35.301
NOW, LAST WEEK, STEVE USED
HIS TRANSFORMATION MACHINE

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:36.836
TO TURN CARL INTO A CAR

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:38.938
AND DRIVE HIM AROUND
THE MONACO GRAND PRIX?

00:00:38.971 --> 00:00:40.206
COME ON!

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.842
HOW MANY TIMES YOU GONNA
USE THIS TRANSFORMATION MACHINE?

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:45.378
THIS WAS SUPPOSED
TO BE A BLUE COLLAR<i> COSBY SHOW.</i>

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.313
NOW YOU'RE TURNING IT
INTO GODDAMN<i> QUANTUM LEAP.</i>

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:48.781
WHO WRITES THIS [bleep]?

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:50.983
- OKAY, I COULDN'T TELL YOU
EVEN IF I WANTED TO, OKAY, MAN?

00:00:51.016 --> 00:00:52.552
WE GOT, LIKE,
21 WRITERS UP THERE, OKAY?

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:53.853
KNOW WHAT I'M SAYING,
REGINALD?

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.621
BUT YOU AND I BOTH KNOW
THAT THEY DON'T DECIDE

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:56.856
WHAT HAPPENS IN THIS SHOW, OKAY?

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.791
WE BOTH KNOW WHO DECIDES
WHAT HAPPENS IN THE SHOW.

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:02.195
- TWO WEEKS AGO STEVE URKEL USED
HIS INVISIBILITY RAY ON CARL

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.230
AND I WASN'T
EVEN IN THE GODDAMN EPISODE.

00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:05.698
IT WAS JUST MY VOICE.
- YES, I KNOW.

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:06.999
I KNOW, REGINALD.
I'M SORRY.

00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:09.035
I [bleep] APOLOGIZE.
IT'LL NEVER HAPPEN AGAIN.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.204
- THEN STEVE USED HIS
VOICE-CHANGING RAY TO TURN CARL

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.805
INTO A HIGH-PITCHED,
NERDY VOICE.

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:14.574
WHO DO YOU THINK
PROVIDED THE VOICE FOR THAT?

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.709
- DON'T GET TOO FEISTY
ON ME NOW, REG.

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:18.177
LET'S NOT GO DOWN THAT PATH,
OKAY?

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.780
- OH, OH, WE ARE GOING
DOWN THAT PATH, GENE.

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:24.884
IN A COUPLE OF WEEKS,
HARRIET, EDDIE, LAURA, GRANDMA,

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:27.553
AUNT RACHEL, LITTLE RICHIE,
AND THE OTHER LITTLE KID

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:29.856
ARE GONNA GET TELEPORTED
TO ANOTHER DIMENSION,

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.492
AND THEN STEVE INJECTS CARL
WITH HIS OWN DNA,

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.660
SO CARL
TURNS INTO ANOTHER STEVE URKEL.

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:36.529
THAT'S TWO STEVE URKELS
AND NO FAMILY

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:37.763
ON A SHOW CALLED<i> FAMILY MATTERS.</i>

00:01:37.796 --> 00:01:39.265
HOW THE [bleep] DOES THAT WORK?

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:40.833
- LISTEN, LISTEN, REGINALD.
I DON'T KNOW WHAT TO TELL YOU.

00:01:40.866 --> 00:01:42.935
URKEL MANIA IS UNSTOPPABLE,
OKAY?

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:44.103
HE'S A PHENOMENON.

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:45.705
THERE'S NOTHING
WE CAN DO ABOUT IT, OKAY?

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.206
IT'S UP TO S--

00:01:47.239 --> 00:01:48.207
HIM.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.409
- NO, NO, NO, NO, NO!

00:01:50.442 --> 00:01:52.612
I'M AN ACTOR.
I'M A [bleep] ACTOR.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.280
I AM A REAL ACTOR.

00:01:54.313 --> 00:01:55.548
I DID<i> RICHARD III.</i>

00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:57.583
I WAS IN<i> TRUE WEST</i>
WITH SHERMAN HEMSLEY.

00:01:57.616 --> 00:01:59.218
I WAS IN<i> DIE HARD,</i> DAMN IT.

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:00.786
[bleep] STEVE URKEL!

00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:02.355
- [bleep]--
YOU WILL SUCK

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.956
STEVE URKEL'S [bleep]
IF HE WANTS YOU TO!

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.159
YOU WILL SUCK HIS [bleep]
[bleep], DO YOU UNDERSTAND?

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.528
HE IS OUR BREAD AND BUTTER,
YOU MOTHER[bleep]!

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.862
I AM HIGH ON COCAINE!

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:11.430
- I'M A [bleep] ACTOR, GENE!

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:13.900
I DONE MORE COCAINE
THAN YOU WEIGH, MOTHER[bleep]!

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:16.369
- I'M GONNA TELL YOU WHAT YOU
ARE, REGINALD VELJOHNSON.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:20.406
YOU'RE A [bleep] PAWN
IN THAT NERD'S GAME.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:22.742
YOU ARE A [bleep] PAWN!

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:26.012
DO YOU THINK I HAVE ANY POWER
OVER WHAT THAT MONSTER DOES?

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.113
ANY POWER AT ALL?

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:29.282
- AHH!

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:32.785
- I AM THE SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT
OF DEVELOPMENT

00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:35.821
FOR THE AMERICAN BRO--

00:02:35.854 --> 00:02:39.926
- GENE?
GENE?

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:44.764
GENE, WHAT'S BECOME OF YOU,
GENE?

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:49.635
- I AM NOTHING.

00:02:49.668 --> 00:02:51.470
- GENE, I DON'T KNOW
WHAT YOU MEAN BY THAT, GENE,

00:02:51.503 --> 00:02:53.005
BUT YOU'RE SCARING ME.

00:02:53.038 --> 00:02:55.074
OH, NO, DON'T, DON'T,
DON'T DO ANYTHING CRAZY, GENE.

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:56.642
EVERYONE DOES TOO MUCH COKE
SOMETIMES,

00:02:56.675 --> 00:02:58.911
BUT DO THE--JUST, WHAT ARE YOU
GONNA DO WITH THE GUN, GENE?

00:02:58.944 --> 00:03:01.314
WHAT ARE YOU GONNA DO?
DON'T--NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.449
WE CAN TALK THIS THROUGH.

00:03:03.482 --> 00:03:04.884
OKAY?

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:07.787
- THE KING IS DEAD.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.355
LONG LIVE THE KING.

00:03:09.388 --> 00:03:12.892
- NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO!

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:21.601
