00:03:28.874 --> 00:03:31.010
- JALEEL.
- JALEEL?

00:03:31.043 --> 00:03:32.945
THERE IS NO JALEEL.

00:03:32.978 --> 00:03:35.047
ONLY STEVE.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.316
IT'S ALWAYS BEEN STEVE.

00:03:37.349 --> 00:03:42.788
- YIPPIE KI-YAY, MOTHER[bleep]!
[gun clicking]

00:03:42.821 --> 00:03:45.391
- FORGETTING SOMETHING, CARL?

00:03:45.424 --> 00:03:46.525
- DON'T YOU COME NEAR ME.

00:03:46.558 --> 00:03:48.227
