CARL.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:53.933
JUST SAY YOUR LINES

00:03:53.966 --> 00:03:56.068
AND TAKE THE MONEY.

00:03:56.101 --> 00:03:57.770
- YOU'RE A MONSTER.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.376
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.945
I, I, I, I CAN'T CONTROL--

00:04:05.978 --> 00:04:07.880
- AM I DOING THIS?

00:04:07.913 --> 00:04:09.081
- NO, NO, NO,

00:04:09.114 --> 00:04:10.216
NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.

00:04:10.249 --> 00:04:12.318
STEVE, I'LL DO ANYTHING.

00:04:12.351 --> 00:04:15.254
- YOU WILL DO
WHAT I WANT ON<i> FAMILY MATTERS.</i>

00:04:15.287 --> 00:04:18.724
- YES, YES.

00:04:18.757 --> 00:04:20.460
OF COURSE, STEVE.

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:28.501
- SEE YOU ON SET, CARL.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.703
- GET OUT OF MY HOUSE, STEVE!

